{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i> Explore abandoned locations and return the items to their rightful places. </i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each task begins with a set of photographs showing the rooms and objects where the delivered items must be placed. Stay alert \u2014 some of them might be fake, trapped, or simply wrong. Look for clues in the environment, compare every detail on the photos, listen carefully, and don\u2019t rush \u2014 any mistake might wake up what\u2019s hiding nearby.      <br>      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/08401f16d43237f74334d009b1571cb1.poster.avif?t=1765614556\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/08401f16d43237f74334d009b1571cb1.webm?t=1765614556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/08401f16d43237f74334d009b1571cb1.mp4?t=1765614556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>Hold the doors if you want to survive. </i></strong>    <br>     <br>Sometimes that\u2019s the only thing separating you from what\u2019s roaming the halls. Stay coordinated \u2014 while one player sorts the items, another keeps the path open. Or closed. Mistakes and panic decide the outcome faster than the monster ever will.       <br>      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/db438046a3c1f13ed38208d96736403c.poster.avif?t=1765614556\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/db438046a3c1f13ed38208d96736403c.webm?t=1765614556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/db438046a3c1f13ed38208d96736403c.mp4?t=1765614556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>Keep track of your vitals through your robot companion. </i></strong> <br> <br>It monitors your health, noise, weight, and other important parameters.<strong><i>\u00a0</i></strong>Sometimes it reacts to danger before you even notice it \u2014 flickering, warning, or freezing completely. Work as a team, make decisions on the fly, and try to survive the shift\u2026 not every courier manages to finish theirs.       <br>       <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/142d8bdb7a7b8f29c9dcfe3969d6b8b7.poster.avif?t=1765614556\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/142d8bdb7a7b8f29c9dcfe3969d6b8b7.webm?t=1765614556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/extras/142d8bdb7a7b8f29c9dcfe3969d6b8b7.mp4?t=1765614556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132280?t=1765614556","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/f54db5b65cc6859007b10fdac23163a02781e9cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765614556","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/540d2e902abb90028811213faeb6449652620348/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765614556","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132280/540d2e902abb90028811213faeb6449652620348/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765614556","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description